import{_ as i,o as n,c as a,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const y=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 934 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · General Introduction | Final Finalization of the Heavenly-Dao Rules","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 934 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · General Introduction | Final Finalization of the Heavenly-Dao Rules","no":934,"module":5,"tags":["Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules","General Introduction","Heavenly-Dao Laws","Civilizational Finalization","Law Priority"],"related":["04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis","03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","901-Civilizational Final-Finalization Jurisprudential Basis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0934_模块5-天道规则总论-天道规则终极定型.md","filePath":"en/0934_模块5-天道规则总论-天道规则终极定型.md"}'),o={name:"en/0934_模块5-天道规则总论-天道规则终极定型.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,u,c){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-934-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-general-introduction-final-finalization-of-the-heavenly-dao-rules" tabindex="-1">Entry 934 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · General Introduction | Final Finalization of the Heavenly-Dao Rules <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-934-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-general-introduction-final-finalization-of-the-heavenly-dao-rules" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 934 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · General Introduction | Final Finalization of the Heavenly-Dao Rules&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 03 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-writing-anti-predation-into-the-cosmos-s-laws-themselves" tabindex="-1">Introduction: writing anti-predation into the cosmos&#39;s laws themselves <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-writing-anti-predation-into-the-cosmos-s-laws-themselves" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: writing anti-predation into the cosmos&#39;s laws themselves&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Universe)&#39;s civilizational final finalization, after the Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter (from Entry 901) completed the institution-layer lock, leaves one last and highest project — sublimating anti-predation from &quot;human law&quot; into &quot;Heavenly-Dao rules.&quot; Human law may be overthrown by the strong&#39;s force and tampered with by conspiracy; once Heavenly-Dao rules are anchored in the cosmic-law network, they resonate with causality and the anchor origin, and any who act against the trend bear law&#39;s counter-restraint from the very moment of their rising thought. This is the master proposition of the Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are here as a whole written into the Heavenly-Dao layer: the anti-predation axiom is this series&#39; spiritual body, the republican axiom of Myriad Races is the object the rules protect, the collective-ascension axiom is the direction the rules guide, the causal self-discipline axiom is the boundary of the rules&#39; operation, and the law-first axiom is the meta-rule under which this series stands — precisely because the law comes first and setting self-consistency outranks all, Heavenly-Dao rules may never retcon and endure through ages. This general introduction does not legislate article by article, but first makes clear: what is the relationship between Heavenly-Dao rules and the charter, on what basis do they bind Myriad Ranks, and how do they interlock with Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-three-layers-of-heavenly-dao-rules" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Three Layers of Heavenly-Dao Rules <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-three-layers-of-heavenly-dao-rules" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Three Layers of Heavenly-Dao Rules&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules total thirty-one rules, plus this general introduction and the closing summary (Entry 966), constituting a complete system. Its structure is three layers:</p><ul><li><strong>Body layer (Rules 1–5)</strong>: increment-development iron law, no-consumption-of-stock iron law, no killing-and-predation as evolutionary path, Great Dao full-level openness, no private hoarding no monopoly — answering &quot;where does power come from&quot;;</li><li><strong>Subject layer (Rules 6–12)</strong>: Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage, all beings&#39; equal evolutionary qualification, strong ones do not ascend alone, lifting Myriad Ranks up together, Myriad-Rank republican co-construction, Alaya network-wide sharing, no great-material-for-small-use — answering &quot;to whom does power belong, and whom does it serve&quot;;</li><li><strong>Boundary layer (Rules 13–31)</strong>: cross-plane reporting, observe-first-then-limited-intervene, knowledge-return-only-without-causality-disturbance, eradicating civilizational regression/historical reversal/cyclical harvesting/class solidification, law comes first, never retcon, setting self-consistency, plot does not kidnap settings, worldview may infinitely expand, predatory cultivation prohibited, enlightened-predator conversion, just-rascal cultivation, shortcut inner-demon prevention, civilizational-weight assessment, law-anchor-authority universal access, Myriad-Rank-origin bidirectional cycle — answering &quot;how is power bound.&quot;</li></ul><p>Thirty-one rules link ring by ring; missing any one leaves a seam in the system.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis-from-where-heavenly-dao-rules-gain-binding-force" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis: From Where Heavenly-Dao Rules Gain Binding Force <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis-from-where-heavenly-dao-rules-gain-binding-force" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis: From Where Heavenly-Dao Rules Gain Binding Force&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heavenly-Dao rules&#39; authority is not &quot;some god said so,&quot; but the result of a triple argument:</p><ol><li><strong>Direct corollary of the law-first axiom</strong>: the cosmic-law network itself precedes all strong ones; predatory systems could run rampant only because the old cosmos never wrote anti-predation into the law layer. Anchor-origin verification shows anti-predation is fully aligned with the cosmic-origin cycle direction;</li><li><strong>Iron evidence from historical retrospective</strong>: the endgame retrospective of all Pre-Anchor Era predatory civilizations (Tang-Luo, Douluo-type sects, Shrouding-the-Sky-type forbidden zones) shows predatory paths necessarily self-exhaust, and anti-predation is the only direction that can close the loop (Document 04 has proven its efficiency ceiling);</li><li><strong>Law-ification of the Myriad-Rank contract</strong>: the civilizational contract signed when Myriad-Rank republicanism was established, after Anchor Council legislation and Symbiotic Court judicial confirmation, is &quot;engraved&quot; into the law network by the Anchor Supervisory Committee&#39;s petition to the cosmic-origin anchor; from then on, defying Heavenly-Dao rules disturbs the anchor.</li></ol><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism-how-heavenly-dao-rules-land" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism: How Heavenly-Dao Rules Land <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism-how-heavenly-dao-rules-land" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism: How Heavenly-Dao Rules Land&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heavenly-Dao rules do not rely on fantastical vague means like &quot;heavenly punishment,&quot; but on precise causal engineering:</p><ul><li>Each rule corresponds to a set of monitoring nodes in the Alaya Network, real-time marking all energy flows, law invocations, and causal disturbances that contradict it;</li><li>Rule triggering is graded early-warning: thought stage (inner-demon prompt) → behavior stage (anchor freezes part of permissions) → accomplished stage (Symbiotic Court prosecution), embodying causal self-discipline&#39;s &quot;prevention first, sanction after&quot;;</li><li>The executing subject is not some Heavenly Emperor, but the Anchor Council (law interpretation), Symbiotic Executive Committee (law enforcement), and Symbiotic Court (judicial) tripartite&#39;s extension at the Heavenly-Dao layer, avoiding &quot;in the name of heavenly punishment actually running dictatorship.&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation-graded-costs-of-defying-heavenly-rules" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation: Graded Costs of Defying Heavenly Rules <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation-graded-costs-of-defying-heavenly-rules" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation: Graded Costs of Defying Heavenly Rules&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: occasional greed, local overstep, gets an Alaya Network inner-demon warning, is forced into the Quest Sediment Domain to reflect, and is not recorded as original sin;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: systematic private hoarding, monopoly, unreported cross-plane interference, has law-anchor permissions frozen, high-level access stripped, and is transferred into the enlightened-predator conversion program;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: restoring predatory cultivation, manufacturing cyclical harvesting, pushing civilizational regression, is isolated, tried, and converted under the Anti-Predation Committee procedure; never counter-killing with killing.</li></ul><p>Heavenly-Dao rules&#39; ultimate consequence is not soul-and-spirit annihilation, but &quot;losing all symbiotic-network benefits&quot; — in an anchor civilization, this is equivalent to being expelled from the evolutionary expressway.</p><h2 id="v-supervising-subject-who-guards-the-heavenly-dao" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subject: Who Guards the Heavenly Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subject-who-guards-the-heavenly-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subject: Who Guards the Heavenly Dao&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Supervision is borne by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: anchor-network automatic monitoring is the first layer, each clan&#39;s autonomous supervision is the second, the Anchor Supervisory Committee&#39;s independent investigation is the third, and Myriad Ranks&#39; direct Heavenly-Dao litigation to the Symbiotic Court is the fourth. The Heavenly Dao belongs to no single Transcended One; the Heavenly Dao belongs to all Myriad Ranks — this is precisely the fundamental difference between Heavenly-Dao rules and the old cosmos&#39;s &quot;Heavenly Dao is some great-power&#39;s will.&quot;</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: writing anti-predation into the Heavenly-Dao layer once for all eradicates predatory systems&#39; hundreds-of-millions-of-years repeated restoration, saving immeasurable civilizational-level trial-and-error energy</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: this series&#39; thirty-one rules all revolve around &quot;develop increments, consume no stock, take no killing as evolution&quot;; they are the anti-predation axiom&#39;s Heavenly-Dao embodiment; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type &quot;Heavenly Dao&quot; is privately defined by strong ones like Gu Chensha, changed on a whim and retconned on a whim; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Heavenly-Dao rules, anchor-origin verified, endure through ages</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the thirty-one rules&#39; protected object is Myriad Ranks 99%, with no clan exception clauses</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Heavenly-Dao rules allow the worldview to expand infinitely; newly added planes and lineages automatically enter rule application without collapsing</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The charter locks institutions; Heavenly-Dao rules lock direction. The Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules is the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s last lock on Myriad Ranks at the cosmic-law layer. After this general introduction establishes the outline, Rule 1 through Rule 31 unfold article by article, ultimately converging at Entry 966&#39;s civilizational-final-finalization guarantee.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">Entry 03 · Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/901_模块5-总论-文明终极定型法理基础.html">Entry 901 · Civilizational Final-Finalization Jurisprudential Basis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/935_模块5-规则一-增量开发铁律.html">Entry 935 · Rule 1 Increment-Development Iron Law</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{y as __pageData,g as default};
